gs include a creepy Victorian mansion, an abandoned hospital and a jungle where forgotten rituals take place.\n\nBecause levels are generated anew, each run plays differently, and the RPG elements let you build up your character over time. It is single-player with full controller support, suited to players who enjoy cosmic horror themes inside a roguelite loop and like combining combat with investigation."}}